&lt;li&gt;Lead the architecture and development of end-to-end software solutions leveraging agentic AI (e.g., LLMs, agent frameworks, RAG, context engineering, and evaluation).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement robust data orchestration and processing pipelines for continuous agent operations and performance improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex customer problems and business requirements into effective, deployable AI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MS or PhD in a science, mathematical, and/or engineering field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in designing and deploying end-to-end AI systems in a production environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth knowledge of current Gen AI technologies and a strong software development background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in building high-performance AI applications that integrate a multitude of data sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundation in machine learning model development, experimentation, and evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead technically across teams, with excellent system design and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
